# Changes to the security controls, to the tests that pin them, and to the
# machinery that checks those tests need a human review -- including changes
# opened by automated agents (Sentinel, Bolt, Copilot, Dependabot).
#
# An agent asked to make a failing check pass can do it by fixing the code or
# by loosening the check. Both produce a green PR; only review tells them
# apart. To make this binding, enable "Require review from Code Owners" in the
# branch protection rule for main -- without it this file only requests review.

/adapt_agent/security/        @CodeHalwell
/adapt_agent/adversarial/     @CodeHalwell
/adapt_agent/core/            @CodeHalwell
/adapt_agent/adapters/        @CodeHalwell
/adapt_agent/integrations/    @CodeHalwell

/tests/                       @CodeHalwell
/scripts/mutation_check.py    @CodeHalwell
/scripts/heldout_check.py     @CodeHalwell
/.github/                     @CodeHalwell
/docs/security.md             @CodeHalwell
/SECURITY.md                  @CodeHalwell
